#. <CLT 23>「ガタガタガタ！」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | NO NAME"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*Rattle rattle*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>“Lạch cạch lạch cạch!”\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>開かない…
#. この部屋には鍵が掛かってる…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The door won't budge. This room must be locked.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今更、ここに入れたところで、
#. どうしようもないけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's no point trying to get in here right now...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
